    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="128" width="392" height="24"><content fontSize="14" bold="true" color="rgb(24,38,58)"><p>01　行人模型 8 条性质全部满足</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="152" width="392" height="44"><content fontSize="11" color="rgb(105,120,140)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45"><p>无死锁、冲突安全、可达、活性、两条时限，命令行与 GUI 两路一致（第 10–11 页）</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="204" width="392" height="24"><content fontSize="14" bold="true" color="rgb(24,38,58)"><p>02　时间约束来自推导，不是猜的</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="228" width="392" height="44"><content fontSize="11" color="rgb(105,120,140)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45"><p>13 秒上界由反例修正、可复算：剩余绿灯 + 黄灯 2 + 全红 1（第 9 页）</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="280" width="392" height="24"><content fontSize="14" bold="true" color="rgb(24,38,58)"><p>03　同步闭环在模拟器里走得通</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="304" width="392" height="44"><content fontSize="11" color="rgb(105,120,140)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45"><p>walkStart / walkDone 双向对得上，Done 可回到 Approach，支持重复请求（第 12 页）</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="356" width="392" height="24"><content fontSize="14" bold="true" color="rgb(24,38,58)"><p>04　统筹部分形成了可复用的口径</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="380" width="392" height="44"><content fontSize="11" color="rgb(105,120,140)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45"><p>三组 Prompt、五个指标、六道评审门禁，全组按同一流程走（第 5–6 页）</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="100" width="418" height="20"><content fontSize="11" color="rgb(105,120,140)" bold="true" letterSpacing="1"><p>尚未确定 / 待补</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="128" width="418" height="24"><content fontSize="14" bold="true" color="rgb(105,120,140)"><p>15 个 raw 模型的统计表</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="152" width="418" height="60"><content fontSize="11" color="rgb(105,120,140)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45"><p>可运行率、语法错误率、语义错误率、修复成本四项数字需等 G2–G8 的样本跑完后填写，本页不预设结论。</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="216" width="418" height="24"><content fontSize="14" bold="true" color="rgb(105,120,140)"><p>v3 故障与超时恢复</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="240" width="418" height="60"><content fontSize="11" color="rgb(105,120,140)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45"><p>故障注入后的恢复性质尚未单独验证；目前全部结论只覆盖 v1 正常模型。</p></content></shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="304" width="418" height="24"><content fontSize="14" bold="true" color="rgb(105,120,140)"><p>结论的适用范围</p></content></shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="494" topLeftY="328" width="418" height="60"><content fontSize="11" color="rgb(105,120,140)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45"><p>8/8 只对“单方向单车道 + 一个行人请求”这一边界成立，多车道与复杂配时不在覆盖范围内。</p></content></shape>

